tr.td:
1 year to less than 17 years
Starting dosage 0.5 mg/ kg once daily; or 0.25 mg/kg twice daily; may increase to 1 mg/kg once daily at bedtime or 0.5 mg/kg twice daily;
Maximum of 40 mg per day

Birth to less than 3 months
Starting dosage 0.5 mg/kg once daily;
may increase to 1 mg/kg once daily

3 months to less than 1 year
Starting dosage 0.5 mg/kg twice daily;
may increase to 1 mg/kg twice daily;
Maximum of 40 mg per day
